Wizard mode:  (must be the administrator on multi-user systems)

nethack -uwizard -D
nethack -uWizard -D
(try those)

And yes, you either have to be Neutral or be a Valkyrie (I don't know which
the program checks) to use it.  I think your alignment has to be aligned also.

